 oss the city and region.\nAward: Competition awards with prize money (amou
 nts not published): International Competition\, French Competition\, First
  Film\, Flash (shorts)\, Georges de Beauregard\, Cnap\, Renaud Victor\, GN
 CR Distribution Support\, Audience and others. The Claudia Cardinale Found
 ation Award was a one-month residency in 2026. Entry fee EUR 30 for films 
 under 60 minutes\, EUR 50 for 60 minutes or more\; no waivers mentioned. T
 ravel and accommodation are not mentioned\; films in competition get accre
 ditation for the director and one production representative.\nDuration: Fe
 stival 6 to 11 July 2027\n\nMore: https://fidmarseille.org/en/festivals/fe
 stival-38/appel-a-films-2027?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_med
