SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 EET: G & A Mamidakis Foundation Art Prize 2027: EUR 
 15\,000 plus full production for a permanent outdoor installation in Crete
DESCRIPTION:Closes 30 Dec 2026 at 23:59 EET.\n\nThe George & Aristea Mamida
 kis Foundation Art Prize\, running since 2019\, commissions one new site-s
 pecific artwork each year for the Foundation's collection. The 2027 prize 
 asks for a large-scale sculptural installation for permanent outdoor displ
 ay in Agios Nikolaos\, Crete\, meant to become a landmark in its setting.\
 n\nOrganisation: G & A Mamidakis Foundation\nLocation: Agios Nikolaos\, Cr
 ete\, Greece. Open to Greek and international artists. The work is made be
 tween February and May 2027 and installed on site.\nAward: EUR 15\,000 pri
 ze (30% on acceptance\, 70% on delivery\, against an invoice). The Foundat
 ion also covers all construction\, transport and installation costs of the
  work\, one return ticket to Crete\, and accommodation and meals at Minos 
 Palace for up to ten days. No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: Produc
 tion February to May 2027\; unveiling June 2027\n\nMore: https://gnamamida
 kisfoundation.org/en/vraveio-technis/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdes
